  <ym-title|Free reference rank and point
  probes><label|free-reference-rank-and-point-probes>

  <\itemize-minus>
    <item>Unit: YM-000026, finite free-reference trace rank.

    <item>Status: draft; independent mathematical and source-correspondence
    review pending.

    <item>Source revision: <verbatim|3456e5e75cf8d4cd558955a5c7638fba2d68f464>
    (<verbatim|source/upstream.json>).

    <item>Manuscript: <verbatim|manuscript/existence/trace-free-rank.tex>.

    <item>Scope: explain and prove the finite Green-function probes,
    low-grade signed-covariance bounds, equation-of-motion quotient bound,
    and the free rank-one closure conclusion.
  </itemize-minus>

  <section|Correspondence><label|correspondence>

